  "notes": "{蒔|ま}く is a godan verb specifically meaning to sow or plant seeds.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦{種|たね}→種：02157_tane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒔|ま}く\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{種|たね}→種：02157_tane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒔|ま}く: to sow seeds\n- ⟦{畑|はたけ}→畑：00842_hatake⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{蒔|ま}く: to sow in the field\n- ⟦{花|はな}→花：00523_hana⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{種|たね}→種：02157_tane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒔|ま}く: to plant flower seeds\n\nHOMOPHONES (different kanji, different meanings):\n- ⟦{巻|ま}く→巻く：02418_maku⟧: to wind, roll up\n- ⟦{撒|ま}く→撒く：12711_maku⟧: to scatter, sprinkle (water, etc.)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n{蒔|ま}いた⟦{種|たね}→種：02157_tane⟧: what one has sown - consequences of one's own actions. Often in ⟦{自分|じぶん}→自分：02887_jibun⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{蒔|ま}いた⟦{種|たね}→種：02157_tane⟧ (the seeds you yourself sowed).",
